{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/integration-basics/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/integration-basics.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Integration Basics — Calculus","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Integration Basics</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Antiderivatives &amp; area</h2><div class=\"muted mt-2\">Integration reverses differentiation. ∫ x^n dx = x^{n+1}/(n+1) + C. Definite integrals compute area under curves.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Visual — area under curve</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 muted\">Area between curve and x-axis from a to b equals definite integral ∫_a^b f(x) dx.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"420\" height=\"140\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M20,120 C80,80 140,40 200,30 260,40 320,70 380,100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fb7185\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n          <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#fecaca\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect>\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">Example area (a→b)</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Worked examples</h2>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-3 muted\">\n        <li>∫ x^2 dx = x^3/3 + C.</li>\n        <li>Definite: ∫_0^1 x dx = 1/2.</li>\n        <li>∫ 3x^2 dx = x^3 + C (constant multiple).</li>\n        <li>Compute ∫_0^2 x^3 dx = [x^4/4]_0^2 = 16/4 = 4.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Integrate ∫ 3x^2 dx</div><input id=\"int1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., x^3 + C\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"inc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"inh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"ifb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) Evaluate ∫_0^1 x dx</div><input id=\"int2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"inc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"inh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"ifb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"intQuiz\" class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quick Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"intModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"intContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"intClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-rose-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .muted{color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}